ent {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      font-size: 17px;\n      line-height: 1.62;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    p {\n      margin: 0 0 1px;\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .lead {\n      margin-bottom: 2px;\n    }\n    h2 {\n      margin: 0;\n      font-size: 22px;\n      line-height: 1.32;\n      color: #4d2868;\n      font-weight: 500;\n    }\n    .name {\n      color: #168d70;\n      font-weight: 700;\n    }\n    .red {\n      color: #a92c2e;\n      text-decoration: underline;\n      text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n      text-underline-offset: 2px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"border\"></div>\n    <div class=\"corner tl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"corner tr\"></div>\n    <div class=\"corner bl\"></div>\n    <div class=\"corner br\"></div>\n    <div class=\"flower top\">✹</div>\n    <div class=\"flower bottom\">✹</div>\n\n    <section class=\"content\">\n      <p class=\"lead\">艾青的诗歌《绿》运用文字的魅力用文学的形式描述了<span class=\"red\">春<br>天到处都是绿色</span>，树木大地中的小草在春风的春拂下来回摆动，<br><span class=\"red\">风是绿的，水是绿的，世界充满了绿。</span>绿是<span class=\"red\">生命</span>的颜色，是<span class=\"red\">生<br>命</span>的象征。</p>\n\n      <h2>11.白桦</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"name\">《白桦》</span>诗歌以白桦为中心意象，从不同角度描写它的美。<br>白桦那么<span class=\"red\">高洁、挺拔</span>，它是<span class=\"red\">高尚人格</span>的象征。</p>\n\n      <h2>12.在天晴了的时候</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"name\">《在天晴了的时候》</span>这是一首生动、活泼、情趣盎然的小<br>诗，诗人以清新、优美的语言，运用<span class=\"red\">拟人</span>的手法、形象的比喻<br>勾勒出一幅幅充满生机的画面，展现了<span class=\"red\">雨后天地间的蓬勃、自<br>然、欢乐和美好</span>，抒发了<span class=\"red\">亲近自然、热爱生活的情怀</span>。</p>\n\n      <h2>13.猫</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"name\">《猫》</span>一文是著名作家<span class=\"red\">老舍</span>的作品，作者通过对猫的<span class=\"red\">古怪<br>性格和满月小猫</span>特点的描写，抒发了对<span class=\"red\">猫的喜爱之情</span>。</p>\n\n      <h2>14.母鸡</h2>\n      <p><span class=\"name\">《母鸡》</span>一文是<span class=\"red\">老舍</span>先生脸炙人口的佳作，描写了作者对<br>母鸡的看法的变化，表达了作者对<span class=\"red\">母鸡的赞颂之情。</span>课文以作<br>